+**36 passed**, 1 warning, 7.03 s
+(including `test_s16_real_podcast_upsert_crash_does_not_enqueue`).
+
+Warnings are `datetime.utcnow()` deprecation from `podcasts.py` /
+`memory_layer.py`. Retained.
+
+## Limitations
+
+- Ticketless raw `publish_transcript` still mints for first publication,
+  idempotent current target, and empty replacement so the frozen
+  evaluation helper (`_publish`) keeps working. Index never mints.
+- `_seed_index` no longer calls `publish_media_snapshot`; it uses `_seed`
+  so BD-01 Index can publish B through `_publish` without a pre-existing
+  ledger. Later BC-2 Index publications use `_index_publish` with a ticket.
+- Sidecar merge prefers disk for non-owned keys that changed after mint
+  (`media_depth` and `transcript` stay with this publication).
+- Astra's tests were not edited. No commit.
+
+## Files
+
+`library_media.py`, `index.py`, `tests/test_phase6_bc2.py`,
+`docs/library/PHASE6-BC3A2-GROK-2026-09-08.md`.
